*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.p12 binary
*.pfx binary
*.pdf binary
